# Modernization Constraints

When modernizing this repository:

- **No new dependencies** — version bumps and direct replacements only in pom.xml
- **Do not touch migrations** — db/migration, flyway, liquibase, schema.sql, data.sql
- **Do not change public API** — Controller signatures, URL paths, request/response shapes, DTOs
- **No behavioral improvements** — if tests fail, the refactor is wrong
- **One batch at a time** — no drive-by refactors

Characterization tests must pass before and after every change batch.
